OL,3,GNEWSAChief constable apologises after
OL,4,Aex-senior officer discriminated against
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Chief Constable Jon Boutcher
OL,7,Fsaid: "There is and should be no place
OL,8,Ffor behaviour like this in the PSNI. We
OL,9,Fare committed to a workplace culture of
OL,10,Fequality, diversity, and inclusion."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
